Using Division and Modulo Operator - O(log n) time and O(1) spaceThe idea is to repeatedly divide the number by 2 and check if there's any remainder during the process. If n is a power of 2, then dividing it by 2 repeatedly will eventually reduce it to 1 without encountering any odd number in between. If at any point n becomes odd (except for the final value 1), then n is not a power of 2.
